      "title" : "The day you let the big beat take over and never looked back",
      "description" : "From a caffeine-fuelled morning through a relentless afternoon, you let Underworld, The Chemical Brothers, and The Prodigy set the tempo. Every track pulsed with energy—“Born Slippy (Nuxx)” and “Juanita: Kiteless: To Dream Of Love” led the charge. 377 minutes, 60 tracks, 18 artists—your most energetic day of the year.",
